  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Mrida Intelligent Transportation System Modernization, through Nathan Associates Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Mrida Intelligent Transportation System (ITS) Modernization Technical Assistance in Mexico is to support the deployment of ITS technologies, to modernize the bus control and monitoring center, and to advance the transition to electric buses for the public transportation fleet in Mrida, the capital of the State of Yucatn. The technical assistance would support Instituto de Movilidad y Desarrollo Urbano Territorial&apos;s (IMDUT) Integrated Transport System Project by providing recommendations for the selection of ITS and electric mobility solutions to modernize Mridas public transportation system.</narrative>
  </description>
